DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuttvvffuu driver supports USB Audio/Video capture devices based on the
     Fushicai USBTV007 chip.  The following product models are known to work:

           ••   Play X Store Capture
           ••   YXGOOD EasyCAP

     If the uuttvvffuu device attaches successfully, it will attach the audio(4)
     and video(4) drivers to provide higher-level access.

